() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(\(a\) All wiring work shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The earthing arrangement of the supply system is TN-S.) Tj T*
(\(c\) All wiring shall run concealed in rigid PVC conduit having 1.5 m.m. wall) Tj T*
(thickness.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Wires are to be single core, stranded copper conductor, FR PVC insulated,) Tj T*
(450/750 V grade to IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Copper conductors of 1.5 mm2 shall be used for lighting circuits and 4 mm2) Tj T*
(for power circuits.) Tj T*
(\(f\) MCBs shall comply with IS/IEC 60898-1 and have a rated short-circuit) Tj T*
(capacity of 10 kA rms.) Tj T*
(\(g\) MCBs from 6 ampere up to 32 ampere shall be provided as per the single line) Tj T*
(diagram.) Tj T*
(\(h\) All socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs complying with) Tj T*
(IS 12640 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(\(i\) The earthing installation shall comply with IS 3043:1987.) Tj T*
(\(j\) The main distribution board shall be earthed through two pipe earth) Tj T*
(electrodes.) Tj T*
(\(k\) Resistance of the earthing system shall be not more than 1 Ohms.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
