(\(a\) Detailed shop drawings are to be submitted by the contractor for approval) Tj T*
(not later than 21 calendar days after the award of work.) Tj T*
(\(b\) On completion the contractor shall hand over three copies of the O&M) Tj T*
(manuals.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The contractor shall guarantee the whole installation for 12 months after) Tj T*
(handing over against faulty design, materials and workmanship.) Tj T*
